# Bobby charging (Nova + phone)

Wrong apartment = real money. Never type or send a NovaSys password.

## Who works

- Laptop `watch_open.py` refreshes Open every ~2 min. No AI on empty ticks.
- **Auto Pay:** on a new chargeable RU the laptop opens it, fills Create payment, and **Pays only if apartment + T1/T2 + amount match**. Then attach + SET PIN + Ok. Do not wait for this chat to say Pay. Wake this chat after success or fail (dashboard). Hard RUs also wake this chat. Recheck Bot Off and the boxes immediately before Pay.
- **Website Bot Off = everything off.** No Home → Requests, no PLANB, no Pay, no SET PIN. This chat stops. Same as **Bobby stop watching**. If the switch cannot be read, treat as Off.
- One RU at a time, **oldest first**. Finish it (Pay + attach + SET PIN + Ok, **or** cannot_charge + Back) before the next.
- **Watch waits.** Do not open the next RU, do not run PLANB, while **Invoice** or **Create payment** is open, or while SET PIN on the current RU is not finished. Two jobs on one phone is how the wrong paper gets attached.
- Other tabs (HR / Sheets) do not touch ADB or Nova.
- Spoken “close” = **SET PIN** only. Never tap **Close request**. After success, tap **Ok** only.

## Phone

- App `com.abacuscambridge.empireworldErbil`. Refresh = Home → Requests **only when the main Staff bar is showing** (Home / Requests / Tasks / Account).
- After **grey / red X / cannot_charge / any fail**: **Back (Navigate up)** off Request Detail / Items **before** the next refresh. Fail does not SET PIN, so the phone stays on that RU until we leave it.
- Request Detail / Items use their own bottom tabs. Home `(134,2144)` and Requests `(405,2144)` hit those tabs and **never** reach the Open list. That is why `open=0` can be a lie.
- A dump with `Request ID` / `SET PIN` / `Request Detail` and **no** `Buy - RU-` is **not** an empty Open list. Back first, then Home → Requests, then read cards. Grey skips **that RU only**; other Open RUs still get done.
- Do not spam Back from Home — that opens **Exit Application**. Tap **NO** if it appears.
- **RU-#####** is unique. Charge once per RU.
- Items: **IQD before the dot, no comma.** Ignore **Qty**. Ignore **FM-…**. Ignore a 50 K header if the line IQD is different. Example: Qty 2 + `IQD 100000.0` → Pay **100000**.
- National → **T1**. Generator → **T2**.
- Attachments = **Invoice paper photo only** (window titled Invoice, not Nova’s payments grid). Remarks empty. PIN always `Charged`.
- Attach file name is **`invoice-RU-######.jpg`** (the RU, not the apartment). Push that new file, pick **only that name** in Gallery. Never tap a leftover `IMG_…` or an old `invoice-WW-…` / `invoice-ES-…`.
- Before SET PIN, the paper on the request must show this RU’s **apartment + amount** (and 156 vs 480). If it does not match, stop — do not SET PIN.

## Nova vs overseas

- **Nova:** `ES-` and `WW-12` … `WW-15`. Search as the phone except ES4 `ES-4-17-02` → `ES4-17-2` and ES6 `ES-6-{floor}-{apt}` (floors 2–24, apts 1–6).
- **Overseas (ignore, no charge, no dashboard):** `RV-`, `RA-`, `WD-`, `WW-1` … `WW-11`.
- Charge only if first column is **green circle + white tick**. Ignore orange/red **row fill**. Grey clock / red X = no Pay, no SET PIN; still save dashboard with the cause; then **leave that request** and keep watching. Trust the search screenshot if pixels say pending.

## Pay

- Tariff is a **dropdown only**. Never type T1/T2. Nova often opens on T2.
- Before Pay, the Create payment boxes must show the same **apartment + T1/T2 + amount**. Else stop.
- T1 = 156 IQD/kWh. T2 = 480 IQD/kWh.
- Login: if user **swar** and password **empty** → **Cancel**, then **close Nova** and **open Nova** again. When **Attention!** “data base version is obsolete” appears → **Yes**. Never type the password. Never OK the empty login. Never OK the “Logging in” box.
- Charged dashboard rows need an invoice URL. Waiting rows need a note. Unique on `ru`. Set `started_at` when the RU starts.

## Commands

- **Bobby stop watching** → stop the laptop watch (no Home → Requests, no Pay, no SET PIN).
- **Start watching Bobby** → start `watch_loop.ps1` (exits when the website Bot is Off).
- Website **Turn Off** → laptop watch exits; Pay / SET PIN / PLANB refuse to run; this chat does not continue a charge.
